  46\t| 746 | v28 | v21 | O |  | overlapping scopes, growth against its amount, another period, or margin against revenue |\n    47\t| 746 | v28 | v16 | O |  | overlapping scopes, growth against its amount, another period, or margin against revenue |\n    48\t| 746 | v28 | v8 | O |  | overlapping scopes, growth against its amount, another period, or margin against revenue |\n    49\t| 746 | v28 | v17 | O |  | overlapping scopes, growth against its amount, another period, or margin against revenue |\n    50\t| 821 | v29 | v1 | W |  | two financing amounts of different kinds |\n    51\t| 821 | v29 | v2 | W |  | two financing amounts of different kinds |\n    52\t| 821 | v29 | v15 | W |  | two financing amounts of different kinds |\n    53\t| 821 | v29 | v8 | W |  | a financing amount against a revenue, growth or margin question |\n    54\t| 821 | v29 | v9 | W |  | a financing amount against a revenue, growth or margin question |\n    55\t| 821 | v29 | v14 | W |  | a financing amount against a revenue, growth or margin question |\n    56\t| 821 | v29 | v16 | W |  | a financing amount against a revenue, growth or margin question |\n    57\t| 821 | v29 | v17 | W |  | a financing amount against a revenue, growth or margin question |\n    58\t| 821 | v29 | v21 | W |  | a financing amount against a revenue, growth or margin question |\n    59\t| 821 | v29 | v28 | W |  | a financing amount against a revenue, growth or margin question |\n    60\t| 1029 | v32 | v1 | W |  | two financing amounts of different kinds |\n    61\t| 1029 | v32 | v2 | W |  | two financing amounts of different kinds |\n    62\t| 1029 | v32 | v15 | O |  | a licence payment commitment may sit inside supply commitments |\n    63\t| 1029 | v32 | v29 | W |  | two financing amounts of different kinds |\n    64\t| 1029 | v32 | v8 | W |  | a financing amount against a revenue, growth or margin question |\n    65\t| 1029 | v32 | v9 | W |  | a financing amount against a revenue, growth or margin question |\n    