period, or margin against revenue |\n    84\t| 1238 | v35 | v14 | O |  | overlapping scopes, growth against its amount, another period, or margin against revenue |\n    85\t| 1238 | v35 | v21 | O |  | overlapping scopes, growth against its amount, another period, or margin against revenue |\n    86\t| 1238 | v35 | v16 | O |  | overlapping scopes, growth against its amount, another period, or margin against revenue |\n    87\t| 1238 | v35 | v9 | O |  | overlapping scopes, growth against its amount, another period, or margin against revenue |\n    88\t| 1238 | v35 | v33 | O |  | overlapping scopes, growth against its amount, another period, or margin against revenue |\n    89\t| 1238 | v35 | v8 | O |  | overlapping scopes, growth against its amount, another period, or margin against revenue |\n    90\t| 1238 | v35 | v1 | W |  | a financing amount against a revenue, growth or margin question |\n    91\t| 1238 | v35 | v15 | O |  | supply commitments are bought against expected revenue |\n    92\t| 1238 | v35 | v2 | W |  | a financing amount against a revenue, growth or margin question |\n    93\t| 1238 | v35 | v28 | O |  | overlapping scopes, growth against its amount, another period, or margin against revenue |\n    94\t| 1238 | v35 | v29 | W |  | a financing amount against a revenue, growth or margin question |\n    95\t| 1238 | v35 | v32 | W |  | a financing amount against a revenue, growth or margin question |\n    96\t| 1262 | v36 | v1 | W |  | two financing amounts of different kinds |\n    97\t| 1262 | v36 | v2 | W |  | two financing amounts of different kinds |\n    98\t| 1262 | v36 | v15 | W |  | two financing amounts of different kinds |\n    99\t| 1262 | v36 | v29 | O |  | a convertible-bond investment may or may not count as an equity investment commitment |\n   100\t| 1262 | v36 | v32 | W |  | two financing amounts of different kinds |\n   101\t| 1262 | v36 | v8 | W |  | a financing amount against a revenue, growth or margin question |\n   102\t| 1262 | v36 | v9 | W |  | a financing amount against a revenue, growth or margin question |\n   103\t| 1262 | v36 | v14 | W |  | a financing amount against a revenue, growth or margin question |\n   104\t| 1262 | v36 | v16 | W |  | a financing amount against a revenue, growth or margin question |\n   105\t| 1262 | v36 | v17 | W |  | a financing amount against a revenue, growth or margin question |\n   106\t| 1262 | v36 | v21 | W |  | a financing amount against a revenue, growth or margin question |\n   107\t| 1262 | v36 | v28 | W |  | a financing amount against a revenue, growth or margin question |\n   108\t| 1262 | v36 | v33 | W |  | a financing amount against a revenue, growth or margin question |\n   109\t| 1262 | v36 | v35 | W |  | a financing amount against a revenue, growth or margin question |\n   110\t\n   111\tPairs: 105; R 5, W 57, O 43. The seq-148 pairs were seen before this registration.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
